  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "865a0bed-2d4e-4567-6046-c3d0f2ea1552",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "241bfbc4-00d6-9415-5f6b-2ec8a75cef74",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "As part of its societal commitment to the developing world, AKU has decided to give its donation to Sri Lanka, a brother SAARC country with close traditional ties to Pakistan. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Mr Shamsh Kassim-Lakha, President of AKU, said that \"people from across the world have banded together to help the affected countries and already $2 billion has been pledged towards assistance for this disaster. There is general recognition, however, that the extent of damage will far exceed this sum, especially if we include collateral damage. As such AKU faculty and staff have expressed a desire to contribute towards providing relief to our fellow brethren who are suffering from the aftermath of this calamity.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
